---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Eye Q Hawaii collects, uses, and protects your information, including health information handled in accordance with HIPAA. Serving Hilo and the Big Island."
  noindex={false}
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-sand-50 to-white pt-32 pb-12 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-14">
    <div class="absolute -top-24 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-ocean-100/40 rounded-full blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container-width relative">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Your Privacy</p>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-slate-900 leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-5">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-500">Last updated June 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Body -->
  <section class="pb-20 lg:pb-28">
    <div class="container-width">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-10">
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Eye Q Hawaii ("we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains
          what information we collect through our website, how we use it, and the choices you have. It
          applies to information collected on this website. The handling of your protected health
          information in connection with your care is governed by our Notice of Privacy Practices and
          applicable law, as described below.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Information We Collect</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We collect information you choose to provide and a limited amount of information collected
            automatically when you visit our site:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              <Icon name="lucide:check" class="w-5 h-5 text-ocean-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
              <span><strong class="font-medium text-slate-900">Information you give us.</strong> When you submit an appointment request or contact form, we collect details such as your name, phone number, email address, and any message or appointment preferences you share.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              <Icon name="lucide:check" class="w-5 h-5 text-ocean-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
              <span><strong class="font-medium text-slate-900">Automatically collected information.</strong> Like most websites, we may collect standard technical data such as your browser type, device, pages viewed, and general location through cookies and analytics tools.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We use the information we collect to:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              <Icon name="lucide:check" class="w-5 h-5 text-ocean-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
              <span>Respond to your inquiries and schedule, confirm, or follow up on appointments.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              <Icon name="lucide:check" class="w-5 h-5 text-ocean-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
              <span>Provide and improve our eye care services and patient experience.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              <Icon name="lucide:check" class="w-5 h-5 text-ocean-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
              <span>Maintain, secure, and improve the performance of our website.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              <Icon name="lucide:check" class="w-5 h-5 text-ocean-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
              <span>Comply with our legal, regulatory, and professional obligations.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Protected Health Information &amp; HIPAA</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            As a healthcare provider, any protected health information (PHI) we receive in connection
            with your care is handled in accordance with the Health Insurance Portability and
            Accountability Act (HIPAA) and applicable state law. Our separate Notice of Privacy
            Practices describes in detail how we may use and disclose your health information and the
            rights you have regarding that information. Please avoid sending sensitive medical details
            through website forms or email; instead, contact our office directly so we can protect your
            information appropriately.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">How We Share Information</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We may share information with
            trusted service providers who help us operate our website and practice (for example,
            scheduling, hosting, or analytics providers), and only to the extent needed to perform
            those services. We may also disclose information when required by law or to protect the
            rights, safety, and security of our patients, our staff, or the public.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to remember your preferences and to
            understand how visitors use the site so we can improve it. We may use analytics services to
            collect aggregated, non-identifying usage data. Most browsers let you control or disable
            cookies through their settings; disabling cookies may affect some features of the site.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Data Security</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect the
            information we hold. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic
            storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Our website is intended for a general audience and is not directed to children under 13. We
            do not knowingly collect personal information from children online without appropriate
            parental involvement. Appointment information for minor patients is provided by a parent or
            guardian.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Your Choices</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            You may contact us to ask about, update, or request deletion of the personal information you
            have submitted through our website, subject to any records we are required to retain by law
            or for legitimate business and healthcare purposes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the "Last
            updated" date above. Your continued use of our website after any change indicates your
            acceptance of the updated policy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please
            reach out to Eye Q Hawaii in Hilo on the Big Island:
          </p>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-sand-50 border border-sand-100 p-6 space-y-4">
            <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700 hover:text-ocean-700 transition-colors">
              <Icon name="lucide:mail" class="w-5 h-5 text-ocean-600 flex-shrink-0" />
              {site.email}
            </a>
            <a href={site.phoneHref} class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700 hover:text-ocean-700 transition-colors">
              <Icon name="lucide:phone" class="w-5 h-5 text-ocean-600 flex-shrink-0" />
              {site.phone}
            </a>
            <p class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700">
              <Icon name="lucide:map-pin" class="w-5 h-5 text-ocean-600 flex-shrink-0" />
              {site.address.locality}, {site.address.regionName}, {site.address.area}
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
